MuleDB -down-> Decision : Mule Match Status

Decision -down-> Client : 6. JSON Verdict (BLOCK_RENDER / SAFE)
Decision -down-> SSE : 7. Threat Telemetry Log
SSE -right-> Dashboard : 8. Real-Time CTI Stream

